<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background-color: #00D09C; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }
    .content { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .theme { margin-bottom: 15px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
    .theme:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .badge { background-color: #f0f0f0; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #00D09C; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h2>Weekly Product Review Pulse</h2>
        <p>{{ date }} | {{ app_name }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hi Team,</p>
        <p>The latest AI-driven analysis of our Google Play Store reviews is ready. We have identified <strong>{{ clusters|length }}</strong> distinct feedback themes this week.</p>
        
        <h3>Top Themes Summary:</h3>
        {% for cluster in clusters[:3] %}
        <div class="theme">
            <strong>{{ loop.index }}. {{ cluster.theme_name }}</strong> <span class="badge">{{ cluster.review_count }} mentions</span>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
        
        {% if clusters|length > 3 %}
        <p><em>...and {{ clusters|length - 3 }} more themes.</em></p>
        {% endif %}

        <center>
            <a href="{{ doc_url }}" class="button">View Full Report in Google Docs</a>
        </center>
        
        <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 0.9em; color: #777;">
            This report was automatically generated by the Weekly Pulse AI Agent.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
